# Sculpt pass log — BioFlo bioreactor

## blockout
- **Goal:** Establish H/W/D tower mass + base footprint.
- **Why:** Reference #1 silhouette is the primary recognition cue.
- **Map:** White body = rounded cuboid; gray plinth inset.

## structure
- **Goal:** Place screen band, three pump slots, left port plate zones.
- **Why:** Reference #2 shows pump stack and side connectors as identity.
- **Map:** pump01–03 vertical; ports on −X face.

## form
- **Goal:** Round body edges; pump blue lids + dark housings; port cylinders.
- **Why:** Soft clinical instrument, not hard CAD box.
- **Map:** Extrude bevels; pump protrusion on +Z.

## material
- **Goal:** ≤6 slots: shell / base / pumpBlue / dark / metal / accent.
- **Why:** Match wiki materials budget; semi-matte.
- **Map:** No textures, logos, or text.

## lighting
- **Goal:** Rely on existing lab studio lighting; no emissive cyber glow.
- **Why:** Warm cartoon lab consistency.
- **Map:** Optional low emissive on screen face only if needed (prefer dark + accent blocks).

## optimization
- **Goal:** tris <15000, meshes <40, materials ≤6.
- **Why:** Home hero prop performance.
- **Map:** Cap cylinder segments; cluster ports; no open glass.
